     than the kit's 108 grid, so the tiles fill the 24 dp. The kit masks the
     back tile where the front one overlaps; a vector drawable has no mask,
     so the clip path is the whole grid with the front tile's padded outline
     as a hole, wound the other way.

     Converted from the kit's SVG, not drawn by hand: one group per SVG
     transform, outer first; each tile its rounded-rect path. -->
